  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7102.12 “Certification of equipment” means a 6 month interval in which the accuracy and precision of a breath test instrument have been verified by the forensic breath testing supervisor.\n\nSource. #12064, INTERIM, eff 1-1-17, EXPIRES: 6-30-17; ss by #12216, eff 6-30-17",
